{"s":54,"v":[{"t":"The Hour has come near, and the moon has split [in two].","w":[["ٱقْتَرَبَتِ","Has come near","iq'tarabati",""],["ٱلسَّاعَةُ","the Hour","l-sāʿatu","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّاعَةُ",258]]],["وَٱنشَقَّ","and has split","wa-inshaqqa","",[["وَ",1],["ٱنشَقَّ",1281]]],["ٱلْقَمَرُ","the moon","l-qamaru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَمَرُ",410]]]]},{"t":"And if they see a sign [i.e., miracle], they turn away and say, \"Passing magic.\"","w":[["وَإِن","And if","wa-in","",[["وَ",1],["إِن",27]]],["يَرَوْا۟","they see","yaraw","",[["يَرَ",60],["وْا۟",3]]],["ءَايَةًۭ","a Sign","āyatan",""],["يُعْرِضُوا۟","they turn away","yuʿ'riḍū","",[["يُعْرِضُ",360],["وا۟",3]]],["وَيَقُولُوا۟","and say","wayaqūlū","",[["وَ",1],["يَقُولُ",16],["وا۟",3]]],["سِحْرٌۭ","Magic","siḥ'run",""],["مُّسْتَمِرٌّۭ","continuing","mus'tamirrun",""]]},{"t":"And they denied and followed their inclinations. But for every matter is a [time of] settlement.","w":[["وَكَذَّبُوا۟","And they denied","wakadhabū","",[["وَ",1],["كَذَّبُ",80],["وا۟",3]]],["وَٱتَّبَعُوٓا۟","and followed","wa-ittabaʿū","",[["وَ",1],["ٱتَّبَعُ",101],["وٓا۟",3]]],["أَهْوَآءَهُمْ","their desires","ahwāahum","ۚ",[["أَهْوَآءَ",560],["هُمْ",3]]],["وَكُلُّ","but (for) every","wakullu","",[["وَ",1],["كُلُّ",43]]],["أَمْرٍۢ","matter","amrin",""],["مُّسْتَقِرٌّۭ","(will be a) settlement","mus'taqirrun",""]]},{"t":"And there has already come to them of information that in which there is deterrence.","w":[["وَلَقَدْ","And certainly","walaqad","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",23],["قَدْ",37]]],["جَآءَهُم","has come to them","jāahum","",[["جَآءَ",57],["هُم",3]]],["مِّنَ","of","mina",""],["ٱلْأَنۢبَآءِ","the information","l-anbāi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَنۢبَآءِ",390]]],["مَا","wherein","mā",""],["فِيهِ","wherein","fīhi","",[["فِي",14],["هِ",5]]],["مُزْدَجَرٌ","(is) deterrence","muz'dajarun",""]]},{"t":"Extensive wisdom - but warning does not avail [them].","w":[["حِكْمَةٌۢ","Wisdom","ḥik'matun",""],["بَـٰلِغَةٌۭ","perfect","bālighatun","ۖ"],["فَمَا","but not","famā",